CodeAuditBot 🛡️
A local AI-powered security code auditor that uses Ollama and Qwen2.5-Coder to perform static analysis on source code files directly through Telegram.
Features
 Local AI Analysis: Runs entirely locally for privacy via Ollama.
 Vulnerability Scanning: Detects SQL Injection, XSS, RCE, and other common vulnerabilities.
 Secure Handling: Automatically validates file extensions and handles errors gracefully.
 Telegraf Integration: Easy interaction via Telegram bot.
Getting Started
1. Install Ollama from ollama.com
2. Download the model by running: ollama run qwen2.5-coder:7b
3. Setup the project:
 Run npm install in your terminal
 Copy .env.example to .env
 Add your Telegram BOT_TOKEN to the .env file
 Run node index.js to start the bot
Built With
 Node.js and Telegraf
 Ollama (Qwen2.5-Coder)
 Winston (Logging)